  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Waghenyi wifumie mashariki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu orevaloghe Bethlehemu isanga ja Judea, iji Herode orekoghe mzuri. Ngelo vui nyuma ya kuvalwa kwake, wamanyi wa nyerinyeri wikacha Jerusalemu kufuma chia ra mashariki; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wikakotia, “Oko hao uja mwana uvalo mzuri wa Wayahudi? Angu nyerinyeri yake daiwonie kufuma chia ra mashariki, nesi dacha kumtasa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji Mzuri Herode wasikira malagho agho, ukakambwa ni chongo andwamweri na wandu wose werekoghe Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko ukawiwanga wakohani wabaa na walimu wa Sharia ukawikotia, “Welee, Masiha uvailwa hao?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawo wikamtumbulia, “Uchavailwa Bethlehemu, isanga ja Judea. Angu niko mlodi oreandikieghe:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Herode ukawiwanga kwa kiviso waja wamanyi wa nyerinyeri, ukakunda kumanya kufuma kwawo ngelo iyo nyerinyeri iwonekie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ukawiduma Bethlehemu ukighamba, “Ghendenyi mpeleleze nicha malagho gha uo mwana, nao mkameria kummbona, muniredie malagho; nani nighende kumtasa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao nyuma ya kumsikira mzuri, awo wamanyi wa nyerinyeri wikaghenda, nao ola ija nyerinyeri wereiwonieghe chia ra mashariki, ereghendieghe imbiri kwawo na kumanga andu aja mwana orekoghe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawo wiendaiwona iyo nyerinyeri, wikaboilwa loli-loli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wikaghenda na kungia andu aja mwana orekoghe, wikammbona uko na mae Maria, wikamdungia ngokoro wikamtasa. Wikafungua mali rawo, wikamfunyira manosi gha dhahabu, ubani, na manemane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawo wiendawonyerwa ni Mlungu kwa ndodo wisakewuya kwa Herode, wikaghala cha mzawo kwa chia zima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kukimbiria Misri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji wameria kughala, malaika wa Bwana ukamfutukia Josefu ndodonyi ukamzera, “Wuka kummbwade mwana na mae, mkimbirie Misri, mkaie ahoeni hata namghoria; angu Herode uchamlola mwana upate kum'bwagha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Josefu ukawuka ukammbwada mwana na mae, ukafuma nakio kughenda Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ukakaia aho hata Herode ukafwa. Agho gherebonyekieghe, eri malagho gha Bwana ghikatie; agho ghereghoreloghe ni mlodi ghighambagha, “Kufuma Misri, ngammbanga Mwana wapo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.11.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos. 11.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kubwaghwa kwa wana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Herode uendamanya angu awo wamanyi wa nyerinyeri wamkita, ukajokwa ni machu loli-loli. Ukafunya momu ghobwagha wana wa womi wose wiseidie miaka iwi wiko Bethlehemu na mbai-mbai yaro; kunughana na icho kimu oreghoreloghe ni awo wamanyi wa nyerinyeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko ghikakatia agho ghereghoreloghe ni mlodi Jeremia:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuwuya kwawo kufuma Misri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao nyuma ya Herode kufwa, malaika wa Bwana ukamfutukia Josefu ndodonyi uko Misri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukamzera, “Wuka kummbwade mwana na mae, kuwuye isanga ja Israeli, angu awo werekundieghe kum'bwagha mwana wamerie kufwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Josefu ukawuka ukammbwada mwana na mae, wikawuya isanga ja Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela iji Josefu wasikira angu Arikelao wabonyero kukaia mzuri wa Judea wulalo ghwa ndee Herode, ukaobua kughenda aho, nao umeria kuwonyerwa ndodonyi, ukaghenda cha isanga ja Galilaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukakaia muzi ghuwangwagha Nazareti; eri malagho ghighorelo ni walodi ghikatisho ghighambagha, “Uchawangwa Mnaziri.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
